(text "NOTES:" (at 20.32 421.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 0f9be9a8-05c4-5946-a4cf-6d1058d3093f))
(text "Use CHERRY MX6C-T3NB tactile switches. The five MP fixation lands connect to GND per CHERRY PCB-reference-design; pins 1/2 form the matrix." (at 20.32 429.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 20cdfbc5-ea5b-575e-88b9-8229ce73c253))
(text "D320-D384 are JSCJ 1N4148WS, SOD-323, C2128. Pin 2 is anode on KB_ROWn; pin 1 is cathode at the per-key switch node." (at 20.32 436.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 17ed29fb-ac2b-53fa-bdd2-8b2951060e7f))
(text "J320 mirrors mainboard J310. Its MP hold-down pads are intentionally netless on manufactured Rev A; C320/C321/J321 are DNP and excluded from that PCB." (at 20.32 444.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid c12d7428-d8d3-5f18-8514-39c68f74580b))
(text "MX ULP hotswap is not planned: use stencil + reflow/hot plate for production and validate rework on a small coupon first." (at 20.32 452.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 59bee0a8-046b-598c-a7e5-1702b00603f8))
(text "Use split space in rev A. Treat Backspace, Enter, left Shift, and both Space keys as mechanical stabilizer/keycap-risk items before full board release." (at 20.32 459.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 3e2d484e-6aba-507b-8bcb-1d5a32e62916))
(text "Legends/keycaps are mechanical deliverables: prototype blank resin/MJF caps and clip coupons before final legends or stabilizer bars." (at 20.32 467.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 64287503-fc2c-506f-b1b0-8d9a9915bf30))
